  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strengthening agricultural production for food security of rural families in western Honduras</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Farming families in the Lempira and Santa Barbara departments in western Honduras face a lower quality of life due to challenging environmental conditions. Programa de Reconstruccin Rural (PRR) promotes the expansion of organic farming systems and farmer-led associations and provides technical and financial assistance to help farmers diversify crops and improve food security. At the IAF, we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Honduras. PRR&apos;s activities promote smallholder agriculture and food production to enhance food security and ensure meaningful opportunities for communities to thrive. This grant is part of the IAF&apos;s efforts to address the root causes of irregular migration in Central America.</narrative>
  </description>
